# FMGRegisteredDevices.py
1.FMG -> System Settings -> Administrators
1) create a API user
2) get the API key

2.create Environment Variable in Powershell to store sensitive information
setx FMG_API_KEY "ech7mdkdcqad61omfg7qw8fsi8sggd1y"
setx FMG_IP "10.81.253.253"

3.check environment variable
PS C:\Users\lhong01> $env:FMG_API_KEY
ech7mdkdcqad61omfg7qw8fsi8sggd1y
PS C:\Users\lhong01> $env:FMG_IP
10.81.253.253

4.If Pycharm could not get the environment variable, please restart the Pycharm.

item["platform_str"]方式如果某台设备没有会报错KeyError: 'platform_str'
item.get("platform_str")会返回 None，不会把整个程序中断。

